# CF-Architect — local development Wrangler secrets
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in the values.
# .dev.vars is gitignored and MUST NOT be committed.
#
# Wrangler reads .dev.vars automatically during `wrangler dev` / `npm start`.
# These values override any [vars] in wrangler.jsonc for local development.
#
# For most local development sessions this file can remain empty.
# @adrianhall/cloudflare-auth activates its interactive login flow automatically
# when real Cloudflare Access headers are absent — no flag required.
# See D06 in docs/DECISION_LOG.md.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Seed admin (optional — only needed if you want to test admin promotion locally)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Email address to promote to role='admin' on first login.
# The promotion only fires on the first INSERT of this user's row.
# SEED_ADMIN_EMAIL=dev@example.com
